### Shorten a URL (returns the same shortUrl again if longUrl was already shortened)
### First 5 request -> shard0
### 6th request -> shard1
POST http://localhost:8090/api/v1/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{"longUrl": "https://example.com/some/very/long/path17?with=query&params=too"}

### Redirect via the short code (use the code from the shortUrl above, e.g. "2")
GET http://localhost:8090/l

### Redirecting an unknown code returns 404
GET http://localhost:8090/doesnotexist

### Shortening an invalid URL returns 400
POST http://localhost:8090/api/v1/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{"longUrl": "not-a-url"}

### Per-IP rate limit: repeat this call more than RATELIMIT_LIMIT times (default 10) within
### RATELIMIT_WINDOW_SECONDS (default 60) to see 429 responses.
POST http://localhost:8090/api/v1/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{"longUrl": "https://example.com/rate-limit-test"}
